source_raw_tex:
\lim_{n\to\Cal F}\int F_k(X_n)\times Y_k
=\lim_{n\to\Cal F}\int F_k(X_n)^{\ssbullet}\times Y_k^{\ssbullet}
=\int Y_k^{\ssbullet}\times Y_k^{\ssbullet}
=\int Y_k^2

